  "description": "Aiden is a quarterback and Seo-Won is a chronically-ill forest boy. Could it be any more obvious? Seo-Won can’t quite bring himself to believe that a popular football player has been crushing on him for years, but Seo-Won’s remote forest home might be the perfect place for romance to take root. But Aiden is only visiting Korea–is two weeks enough time to establish a relationship, or…a family?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
